graph TD
    subgraph Presentation Layer [Frontend - React/Vite]
        ReactUI(React Components)
        TailwindCSS(Tailwind CSS)
        AxiosClient(Axios API Client)
    end
    
    subgraph Application Layer [Backend - Django/DRF]
        APIViews(DRF API Views)
        Serializers(DRF Serializers)
        AuthJWT(SimpleJWT Authentication)
    end
    
    subgraph Data Access Layer [Database]
        DjangoORM(Django ORM)
        SQLiteDB[(SQLite Database)]
    end
    
    ReactUI --> TailwindCSS
    ReactUI --> AxiosClient
    
    AxiosClient -- HTTP Requests --> APIViews
    APIViews --> AuthJWT
    APIViews --> Serializers
    Serializers --> DjangoORM
    
    DjangoORM -- SQL Queries --> SQLiteDB
